OL,3,GNEWSACivic centre back on market after
OL,4,Adeal falls through
OL,5,
OL,6,FA listed civic building is being put
OL,7,Fback to market again after negotiations
OL,8,Fwith a development company to purchase
OL,9,Fit for #5.25m fell through.
OL,11,FCabinet approved a freehold sale of the
OL,12,Fvacant Grade II listed Poole Civic
OL,13,FCentre to MCR Property Group in July
OL,14,Flast year, after the site was marketed
OL,15,Fearlier that year.
OL,17,FThe sale had been expected to be
OL,18,Fcompleted by the end of March this
OL,19,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
